# Upload

```ad-state
filename: "report.pdf"
```

```ad-action?name=upload.file&role=primary&on:click
id: upload
---
Upload {filename}
```

```ad-region
for: upload
phase: pending
---
Uploading {filename}...
```

```ad-region
for: upload
phase: success
---
Done.
```

```ad-region
for: upload
phase: failure
---
Upload failed.
```
